cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "QIK-VRT: Vorstellungskraft, Beobachtung und epistemische Fairness – Audio-Addendum zum bidirektionalen virtuellen Zeitkanal"
type: article
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-01
authors:
  - family-names: Lohmann
    given-names: Ingolf
abstract: >-
  A strictly additive, source-bound scientific addendum that carries forward
  the finite bidirectional virtual-time evidence of QIK-VRT without changing
  its scope. It introduces a realization ladder, an operational observation-
  system predicate and an epistemic-fairness guardrail while leaving hidden
  deployments, physical retrocausality, superdeterminism and claims about free
  will explicitly unresolved.
keywords:
  - QIK-VRT
  - virtual time
  - bidirectional communication
  - imagination
  - observation systems
  - epistemic fairness
  - provenance
  - effect authorization
